    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a89deee6dfcdec0ec8c57f04a6f1adfc644cd037dc28fb65b6f6cfdc8a8178c6",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "敵の手を逃れた主人公たちは、かろうじて、その場を脱した。\n一方、そして、天使憲兵隊と大司教・パンドロンは――。",
      "jp_sha256": "7d080c894058636d6d3767e9e8186c14ca0819115b8c8b36f70b94a2da231153",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "적의 손길을 벗어난 주인공 일행은 간신히 그곳을 빠져나왔다.\n한편, 그리고 천사 헌병대와 대주교 판드론은――.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 58,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "0b940eaeee07e72c6b01f3616ce6abc43d893f5b4dfbd71a8a24ef718b09dae8:000002_1078123253095781489:g0:r57",
      "row_index_0based": 57,
      "serialized_row_index": 57,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "敵の手を逃れた主人公たちは、かろうじて、その場を脱した。\n一方、そして、天使憲兵隊と大司教・パンドロンは――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "844b95b2248cbd3c2e5fa673d2593c5f3936cee06167f0bf37611ee6d25365ae",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "申し訳ありません、大司教。\n賊を逃がしました。",
      "jp_sha256": "512f5f801a8b139a6403117b2f15c4da3125c40106e725f0970d4172d4c0bb62",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "죄송합니다, 대주교님.\n도적들을 놓쳤습니다.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 59,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "0b940eaeee07e72c6b01f3616ce6abc43d893f5b4dfbd71a8a24ef718b09dae8:000002_1078123253095781489:g0:r58",
      "row_index_0based": 58,
      "serialized_row_index": 58,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "天使憲兵",
        "<Off>",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "申し訳ありません、大司教。\n賊を逃がしました。"
      ],
      "speaker": "天使憲兵",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a034a0b98fbb47815ba141dc016b86f3d180c5ef4c7719ece4b5ec15a8e52943",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 11,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ちっ、無能な……。\nだが、まあいい。探し求めていた、このアイテムを\n首尾良く入手出来ただけでも、御の字だ。",
      "jp_sha256": "3fc79b9a01cfedc38a3c09cf4b0f03def98680a2badaae709674f91f82c15579",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "쯧, 무능한 것들…….\n하지만 뭐, 됐다. 찾아 헤매던 이 아이템을\n무사히 손에 넣은 것만으로도 다행이지.",
